    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">compellātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		2. compello. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.,
				<i>an accosting</i>, <i><span class="en">Auct.
				Her. 4, 15, 22</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Esp. with reproach, <i>a
				reprimand</i>, <i>reproof</i>, <i>rebuke</i> (rare), <i><span class="en">Cic. Phil. 3, 7, 17</span></i>; in
				plur., <i><span class="en">id. Fam.
				12, 25, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Gell. 1, 5, 2</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
